<p><strong><font color="blue">Tragedy Strikes America</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, September 11, 2001 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Today at 7:50am CST the first of 2 planes crashed into the World Trade Towers in New York. 18 minutes later a second plane slams into the other tower, a plane crashes into the Pentagon, a 4th plane crashes 80 miles outside of Pittsburgh (unsure at this time if it is related to the other attacts) and another plane was unaccounted for.<br><br>This is the first major terrorist attack on the United States since Pearl Harbor. The death toll could be as high as 50k people. To put this into perspective, the United States only lost 64k americans during the 6 years of the Vietnam war. <br><br>Lets take a moment of our time to say a prayer for those that lost loved ones, the injured, and our nations leaders to find and exact retribution on those responsible for this attack.<br><br>For those of us that play the game Everquest, here is a thought:<br><br>Next time someone KS's your ubermob... think about today and realize how utterly pointless arguing with them about it would be. <i>Santerre</i><br><br>Remember one other thing, it was not only Americans that were Murdered today in those towers, but citizens of other countries as well that had offices in those buildings.<br><br></p>
